501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忆杨梅 其二","author":"苏泂","text":"才熟惟应便送官，摘来和叶上金盘。\n病夫病久无灵药，且服丹砂数百丸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73868,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忆杨梅 其三","author":"苏泂","text":"夏祭先供项里祠，鲜香未咽已闻思。\n昨宵梦里依稀见，满树薰风重压枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73869,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忆杨梅 其一","author":"苏泂","text":"不羡南州锦荔枝，鹤头猩血正红滋。\n老饕隔岁流涎甚，为趣容山半月期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73870,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忆紫芝 其二","author":"苏泂","text":"清才漫仕橐长空，末后翻身尚客中。\n便死托生都是妄，直疑君去作秋风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73871,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忆紫芝 其一","author":"苏泂","text":"几度青衣裹白云，流传仙句世间闻。\n如今一去无踪迹，独自看云不见君。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73872,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无题 其二","author":"苏泂","text":"月样梳横鬓脚倾，弄箫骑鹤上青冥。\n归来自摘金茎露，手写黄庭一卷经。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":73873,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"无题 其一","author":"苏泂","text":"